* lna-a5-commongate -> differential pair with common-mode choke
* Structural change: Replace single-ended input with a differential pair (NM1, NM2), choke L1 for CM return
C C1 VIN1 n0
C C2 VIN2 n1
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 VIN1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM2 n2 VIN2 n1 VSS
L L2 VDD n2
C C3 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n3
NMOS NM3 n3 n3 VSS VSS
R R2 n3 n0
C Cbyp VIN1 VSS